{
  "bodyHash": "8mOj0LZDYyc=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/aerodactyl_banner.png\" width=\"1980\" height=\"660\"></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Cobblemon 模组的官方整合包</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>（For Fabric 版）</em></span></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2tsCcWbiYgA?si=zAfUCC1MLsPih05i\" width=\"700\" height=\"393\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></em></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Cobblemon 功能（目前為止的內容！）：</span><br></strong></em></h4><ul>\n<li>捕捉寶可夢來擴展你的隊伍，與野生寶可夢戰鬥獲得經驗值、升級解鎖新招式，並讓寶可夢進化。共可捕捉超過 700 種寶可夢！</li>\n<li>戰鬥系統採用&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpokemonshowdown.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Pokémon Showdown！</em></a></span>&nbsp;引擎，提供精準的競技對戰機制。</li>\n<li>部分&nbsp;<em>《寶可夢傳說 阿爾宙斯》</em>風格機制，例如回憶招式、戰鬥中實際逃脫，以及由<em>你</em>決定何時讓寶可夢進化。</li>\n<li>戰鬥中可切換自由移動模式。你可以在寶可夢對戰的同時進行建築、採礦或攻擊怪物！</li>\n<li>透過寶可夢圖鑑記錄你看到和捕捉的寶可夢。圖鑑附帶掃描功能，可分析野生寶可夢！</li>\n<li>騎乘你的寶可夢，以時尚的方式探索 Minecraft 世界！</li>\n<li>可在多人模式中與朋友交換和對戰寶可夢。</li>\n<li>使用牧場讓你的寶可夢隨意自由漫步！</li>\n<li>樹果可在野外找到、種植在耕地上、使用堆肥獲得加成效果，並可進行雜交以突變出新品種樹果。</li>\n<li>藥品可透過將農作物和樹果放入釀造台製作。釀造出的藥水具有更強的治療效果！</li>\n<li>世界中存在可發現的遠古建築。部分建築內有鍍金寶箱，可能包含珍貴戰利品或其他驚喜！</li>\n<li>化石可透過在特定地點挖掘可疑的礫石或沙子獲得，之後可使用復活機器使其復活。</li>\n<li>第 1 代至第 9 代的所有寶可夢都可生成並與之對戰，但如果尚未擁有模型，則會以替代玩偶的形式顯示。</li>\n<li>完全支援使用資料包和資源包自訂變種和虛擬寶可夢。你可以參考<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252fguides%252fcustompokemon.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們的指南</a></span>了解如何操作！</li>\n<li><em><strong>……還有更多功能即將推出！</strong></em></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於此整合包：</strong></span></h4><p>Cobblemon 整合包的設計旨在透過改善視覺與音效，並使用眾多最佳化模組，讓你的 Minecraft 體驗更加沉浸，且運行效能優於原版 Cobblemon。此外，還加入了一些生活品質改進功能，在不顯著改變原版 Minecraft 的前提下提升遊戲體驗。整合包中包含了可選的額外內容，例如推薦的資源包和光影包，預設為關閉狀態。</p><p><strong><em>注意：</em>&nbsp;Cobblemon 並<strong>沒有</strong>官方伺服器。</strong>&nbsp;你可以在我們的<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252fen%252fservers\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a></span>或 Discord 的 #server-listings 頻道中找到公開伺服器列表，並將其添加到多人選單。或者，你也可以從如&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a></span>&nbsp;等主機服務商購買自己的伺服器。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/bisect_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2172\" height=\"360\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>技術細節：</strong></em></h5><ul>\n<li>此整合包和伺服器端均可與原版 Cobblemon 伺服器和客戶端連線。</li>\n<li>建議至少分配 2.5 GB 記憶體運作。&nbsp;<em>使用 3 GB 或以上以獲得最佳效能。</em></li>\n<li>此整合包適用於&nbsp;<strong>Fabric</strong>，但 NeoForge 版本也可在<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblemon-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span>取得。 <strong>建議遊玩 Fabric 版本，因其效能更佳。</strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>歡迎來到 Cobbled Farms！</strong></span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/742/408/cobbled-farms-sign.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\"></p><p>歡迎來到 <span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/cobbled-farms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobbled Farms</a></span>，這是一個內建的單人世界，旨在向新手與老手訓練家介紹 Cobblemon 的功能！你的任務是在當地居民外出期間，幫助這個小型農耕社區維護他們美麗的家園。幸運的是，他們花時間留下了書籍，解釋了維護 Cobbled Farms 所需了解的一切，甚至還能教你如何在自己的世界或伺服器中創建自己的農耕社區！請務必在每次重大更新後回來查看教學世界的新版本，以了解 Cobblemon 開發團隊可能新增的任何新功能。祝你農耕愉快！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/742/381/cobbled-farms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"500\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/728750148007493723/1038387126661824512/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><em><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></em></p><p><em><strong>備註：</strong></em> Cobblemon 模組仍在開發中，並會持續積極更新。許多功能仍在開發中或暫用替代方案，直到完成為止。部分現有功能也將隨著我們的持續推進而得到更多完善。未來計劃推出更多功能，包括但不限於 NPC、騎乘寶可夢、培育和建築等。</p><p>加入我們的 Discord 以追蹤開發進度、與團隊交流、提問，並搶先窺探即將推出的功能！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/discord_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"51\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/728750148007493723/1038387126661824512/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>整合包內容</strong><em><br></em></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>此整合包允許客戶端連線至僅運行 Cobblemon 和 Fabric API 的伺服器。<br></em></strong><strong><em>若您想將其中任何模組用於個人用途，請從其原始頁面下載，以支持原作者。</em></strong></p><h4><strong>模組：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-loot-info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Loot Info</a></span>&nbsp;- EMI 插件，用於顯示戰利品表資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fambient-environment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ambient Environment</a></span>&nbsp;- 為生態域顏色添加色彩雜訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></span> - 顯示更多關於食物數值的資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbad-wither-no-cookie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded</a></span>&nbsp;- 將許多大聲的全伺服器廣播音效更改為區域性音效。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-advancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements</a></span>&nbsp;- 放大成就頁面並顯示進度資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-ping-display-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Ping Display</a></span>&nbsp;- 在玩家列表中顯示每個玩家的延遲（以毫秒為單位）。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetter-third-person\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Third Person</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許在第三人稱視角下獨立旋轉攝影機。<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252fc225d60a5d871b3676e2835896a7e0ad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>許可</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcherished-worlds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cherished Worlds</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增書籤和搜尋世界功能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包新增 MCPatcher 的自訂物品紋理（CIT）支援。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclumps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clumps</a></span>&nbsp;- 將靠近的經驗球合併成單一實體以減少延遲。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcobblemon.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></span>&nbsp;- 在 Minecraft 中新增寶可夢。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrafting-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crafting Tweaks</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許使用按鈕旋轉、平衡或清除合成格。<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>許可</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcraftpresence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftPresence</a></span>&nbsp;- 在 Discord 上顯示遊戲中的資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamiccrosshair\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DynamicCrosshair</a></span> - 根據正在觀看的事物改變準心。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增物品和配方檢視器，與 JEI 整合。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Enchanting</a></span>&nbsp;- EMI 插件，提供基本附魔資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Ores</a></span>&nbsp;- EMI 插件，顯示礦物在世界中生成的資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi-professions-(emip)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI professions (EMIP)</a></span>&nbsp;- EMI 插件，新增關於職業工作站的資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-descriptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a></span>&nbsp;- 在附魔書的工具提示中新增附魔描述。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenhanced-attack-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enhanced Attack Indicator</a></span>&nbsp;- 在更多動作中顯示攻擊指示器進度條。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling</a></span>&nbsp;- 跳過渲染看不見的實體以提升效能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features (EMF)</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包新增 OptiFine 的自訂實體模型（CEM）支援。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features (ETF)</a></span>&nbsp;- 為資源包新增 OptiFine 的實體紋理功能（ETF）支援。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffallingleaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Falling Leaves</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增落葉和雪粒效果。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffancymenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FancyMenu</a></span>&nbsp;- 自訂主選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fferrite-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化記憶體使用。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmediatelyfast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ImmediatelyFast</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化即時渲染。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finvmove\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvMove</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增在物品欄中走動的功能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finvmovecompats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvMoveCompats</a></span> - 新增 InvMove 與 EMI 和 JEI 的相容性。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjust-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)</a></span>&nbsp;- JEI 插件，顯示所有狀態效果的資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增物品和配方檢視器。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkrypton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Krypton</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化網路堆疊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增動態光源。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flanguage-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Language Reload</a></span>&nbsp;- 改進語言選擇選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flmd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let Me Despawn</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許撿起物品的生物消失。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flithium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lithium</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增許多遊戲最佳化。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmake_bubbles_pop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Make Bubbles Pop</a></span>&nbsp;- 使氣泡粒子破裂。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpages.medal.tv%252fcobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medal</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增 Medal.tv 與 Cobblemon 的整合。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmonsters-in-the-closet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Monsters in the Closet</a>&nbsp;</span>- 突顯阻礙你睡覺的任何怪物。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnetherportalfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NetherPortalFix</a></span>&nbsp;- 修復多人遊戲中地獄門連結的錯誤。<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>許可</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnot-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a></span>&nbsp;- 為原版動作新增更多動畫。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particle Rain</a></span> - 用粒子效果取代預設天氣，效能比原版雨水更好。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticular\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particular</a></span> - 以粒子為基礎的視覺效果增強氛圍。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpresence-footsteps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Presence Footsteps</a></span>&nbsp;- 讓腳步聲更悅耳且更具動態。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freeses-sodium-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reese's Sodium Options</a>&nbsp;</span>- 改進 Sodium 的選項選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsatin-free-wakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satin Free Wakes</a></span>&nbsp;- 新增物體在水面移動時留下的尾跡，是 <span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwakes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wakes</a></span> 的更新版本。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShulkerBoxTooltip</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許按住 Shift 檢視物品欄中界伏盒的內容。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></span>&nbsp;- 最佳化渲染。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Extra</a></span>&nbsp;- 在影片設定中提供更多選項。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-extras\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Extras</a></span>&nbsp;- 為 Sodium 新增功能以改善體驗和效能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodiumleafculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Leaf Culling</a></span>&nbsp;- 改善樹葉渲染的效能。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-shadowy-path-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Shadowy Path Blocks</a></span>&nbsp;- 配合 Sodium 平滑土徑方塊的陰影。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstendhal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stendhal</a></span>&nbsp;- 更好的書寫工具。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fswingthrough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SwingThrough</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許穿過障礙物（如草）攻擊敵人。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tips</a></span>&nbsp;- 在載入和暫停選單中新增提示。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftooltipfix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ToolTipFix</a></span>&nbsp;- 修正工具提示超出螢幕的問題。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvisuality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visuality</a></span>&nbsp;- 為方塊和實體新增各種粒子效果。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a></span>&nbsp;- 顯示附近地形、玩家和實體的小地圖，並允許使用路徑點。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fxaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's World Map</a></span> - 新增全螢幕世界地圖。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyosbr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Your Options Shall Be Respected (YOSBR)</a></span>&nbsp;- 防止設定被更新覆寫。</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>依賴項：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falmanac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almanac</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Let Me Despawn 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbalm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Crafting Tweaks 和 NetherPortalFix 所需。&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgyazo.com%252f40a91e89ff83c69c3dce16fe8ca184c8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>許可</em></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbisect-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting 伺服器整合選單</a></span>&nbsp;- 由我們的託管合作夥伴所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbookshelf-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bookshelf</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Enchantment Descriptions 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></span>&nbsp;- 許多模組需要它來使用遊戲內的設定選單。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></span>&nbsp;- 所有 Fabric 模組都需要。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a></span>&nbsp;- 所有光影包都需要。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkonkrete\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Konkrete</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 FancyMenu 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmelody\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Melody</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 FancyMenu 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></span>&nbsp;- 允許遊戲內設定 Fabric 模組。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fopen-loader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open Loader</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Tips 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fowo-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">oωo-lib</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Particular 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fprickle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prickle</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Enchantment Descriptions 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium-options-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium Options API</a></span> - 由 Sodium Leaf Culling 和 Sodium Extras 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funilib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UniLib</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 CraftPresence 所需。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyacl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YetAnotherConfigLib</a></span>&nbsp;- 由 Satin Free Wakes 所需。</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>資源包：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Motschen 的 Better Leaves</a></span>&nbsp;(<em>預設未啟用</em>) - 讓樹葉看起來更茂密的資源包。</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>光影包：</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#0a9cfd\"><a style=\"color:#0a9cfd\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders - Reimagined</a></span>&nbsp;(<em>預設未啟用</em>) - 推薦的光影包。</li>\n</ul><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon-assets/-/raw/master/graphics/cobblemon_divider.png?ref_type=heads\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"32\"></strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong><em>Cobblemon 與 Pokémon 或 Minecraft 無關。</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:large\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">M<span style=\"font-size:large\">inecraft 是 Mojang Synergies AB 的商標 ｜ Pokémon 是 Nintendo、Creatures Inc. 和 GAME FREAK inc. 的商標。</span></span></em></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
